        {
          "id": "d08-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q1 2026, management expects stable churn and a step-up in enterprise pipeline. Capital expenditure for Q1 2026 is budgeted at $18.0M, the majority allocated to edge infrastructure.",
